<section class="section intro-section"><div class="shell narrow center reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Less filing. More finding.</p><h2>Document management that works like you wish it did.</h2><p class="section-lead">Drop in a PDF or photo. DocManFu applies OCR, makes the processed document searchable, and can suggest a useful name and tags.</p></div>
<div class="shell feature-bento">
  <article class="bento bento-wide reveal"><div class="feature-icon">⌕</div><div><p class="eyebrow">Full-text search</p><h3>Find the one sentence you remember.</h3><p>Search inside scanned PDFs—not just filenames. Search by type or tag, and filter the document library by upload date.</p><div class="search-card"><span>⌕</span><div><small>Search documents</small><b>“orthodontic lifetime maximum”</b></div><kbd>3 results</kbd></div></div></article>
  <article class="bento bento-dark reveal delay-1"><div class="feature-icon dark">✦</div><p class="eyebrow">Optional AI</p><h3>Your tireless filing assistant.</h3><p>Classify documents, suggest clear filenames, extract useful metadata, and auto-tag—with OpenAI, Anthropic, or local Ollama.</p><div class="tag-cloud"><span>Tax</span><span>Medical</span><span>Insurance</span><span>2026</span></div></article>
  <article class="bento reveal"><div class="feature-icon">▤</div><p class="eyebrow">Built-in OCR</p><h3>Paper becomes data.</h3><p>Turn PDF scans and images into selectable, searchable text with OCRmyPDF and Tesseract.</p><div class="ocr-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>✓ Text recognized</span></div></article>
  <article class="bento reveal"><div class="feature-icon">＄</div><p class="eyebrow">Bill tracking</p><h3>Never lose a due date in a PDF.</h3><p>Store bill amounts, due dates, and payment status directly beside each document.</p><div class="bill-card"><span>Rocky Mountain Power</span><strong>$128.47</strong><small>Due Aug 12 · Unpaid</small></div></article>
  <article class="bento bento-wide bento-privacy reveal"><div><div class="feature-icon">⌂</div><p class="eyebrow">Private by architecture</p><h3>Your filing cabinet should not have a landlord.</h3><p>Run DocManFu with Docker on your NAS, home server, or VPS. You choose where files live, who can access them, and whether to keep AI local, use a hosted provider, or disable it.</p><a class="text-link" href="/self-hosted-document-management/">Why self-host your documents <span>→</span></a></div><div class="privacy-visual"><span class="orbit one">PDF</span><span class="orbit two">JPG</span><span class="orbit three">OCR</span><div><img src="/assets/images/logo-mark.png" alt=""><b>Your server</b><small>Private by default</small></div></div></article>
