<section class="section workflow-section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">A civilized workflow</p><h2>From paper pile to useful archive.</h2></div><p>DocManFu quietly handles the repetitive parts while keeping you in charge.</p></div><ol class="steps"><li class="reveal"><span>01</span><div class="step-icon">↥</div><h3>Upload or watch</h3><p>Drag in PDFs and images, import Evernote ENEX files, or use the companion CLI to watch a scanner folder.</p></li><li class="reveal delay-1"><span>02</span><div class="step-icon">◉</div><h3>Read and enrich</h3><p>OCR extracts text. Optional AI classifies, names, tags, and captures useful metadata.</p></li><li class="reveal delay-2"><span>03</span><div class="step-icon">⌕</div><h3>Find anything</h3><p>Search every word, filter the library, preview the original, and download it whenever you need it.</p></li></ol></div></section>

